sequenceDiagram
  participant S as scheduler owner
  participant E as external effect
  participant F as schedule file
  S->>E: onFire(trigger)
  E-->>S: effect may be committed
  S--xS: crash before persistence
  Note over F: one-shot still exists / lastFiredAt still old
  S->>F: new owner reloads old record
  S->>E: trigger fires again
